WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.775
Last, the dangers and the checklist.

2
00:00:02.775 --> 00:00:07.675
Production before the test stage passes:
the seventh pre-flight check refuses it.

3
00:00:07.675 --> 00:00:11.600
A plan edited after approval:
the approved hash refuses it.

4
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.063
A session in the wrong tenant: the
session check and the plan's tenant check.

5
00:00:16.063 --> 00:00:22.450
The detection API unavailable in GCC:
the portal path, from the same files.

6
00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:26.737
And a rollback written during the
outage: step 6 plans it before go.

7
00:00:26.737 --> 00:00:30.847
The checklist: both settings files
filed, the pre-flight recorded,

8
00:00:30.847 --> 00:00:35.108
the plan's hash approved, the smoke
test's alert, the rollback planned,

9
00:00:35.108 --> 00:00:39.064
every go or no-go row passing,
the production pre-flight passing,

10
00:00:39.064 --> 00:00:42.488
and the first monthly package
at the security officer.

11
00:00:42.488 --> 00:00:43.660
Thanks for watching.
